          "end": 9.66,
          "en": "the token in our persistent way on our computer,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 9.66,
          "end": 12.99,
          "en": "so that it is also there if the app reloads.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 12.99,
          "end": 15.75,
          "en": "Because at the moment, reloading means we lose our state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 15.75,
          "end": 17.22,
          "en": "and we're logged out again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.22,
          "end": 19.17,
          "en": "So before we take care about that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 19.17,
          "end": 22.23,
          "en": "and before we then also protect certain routes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.23,
          "end": 25.02,
          "en": "so that we can't even visit /recipes",
