        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 25.02,
          "end": 26.28,
          "en": "if we're not logged in.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 26.28,
          "end": 29.67,
          "en": "Before all of that happens, let me make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 29.67,
          "end": 33.03,
          "en": "that logging out works so that if I am logged in,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 33.03,
          "end": 36.45,
          "en": "clicking the logout button here does log us out.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 36.45,
          "end": 39.39,
          "en": "And for that, let's go back to the authService.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 39.39,
          "end": 41.76,
          "en": "And in there where we have signup and login,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 41.76,
          "end": 44.31,
          "en": "let's add a logout method.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 44.31,
          "end": 46.53,
          "en": "And logging out is super simple.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 46.53,
          "end": 49.89,
          "en": "In the end we just use our user subject",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 49.89,
          "end": 54.75,
          "en": "and we call next and we pass null to set our user to null.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 54.75,
          "end": 57.9,
          "en": "That's our initial state and that's now the state again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 57.9,
          "end": 60.78,
          "en": "This will make sure that our entire application",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 60.78,
          "end": 62.85,
          "en": "treats the user as unauthenticated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 62.85,
          "end": 65.13,
          "en": "because that's the logic we used everywhere.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 65.13,
          "end": 68.64,
          "en": "And therefore, now we should update our UI",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 68.64,
          "end": 71.82,
          "en": "and all our inter setters will not work correctly anymore",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 71.82,
          "end": 74.13,
          "en": "for requests that require authentication.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 74.13,
          "end": 76.08,
          "en": "Which is exactly the behavior we want",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 76.08,
          "end": 79.26,
          "en": "because we can't authenticate ourselves anymore.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 79.26,
          "end": 80.91,
          "en": "The missing piece of course now just is",
