          "end": 94.83,
          "en": "And in the header component TypeScript file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 94.83,
          "end": 99.83,
          "en": "we can add onLogout here and use the authService",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 100.86,
          "end": 104.61,
          "en": "which we're already injecting to call logout.",
