        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 153.09,
          "end": 156.57,
          "en": "As always needs to be imported from @angular router.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 156.57,
          "end": 160.5,
          "en": "And with the router injected, we can redirect here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 160.5,
          "end": 162.93,
          "en": "in the logout method again to make sure",
